\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Dundy County record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025, August to September ran 206% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran 47% that same year. Grid 24415 had its driest year in 2002 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
